    <h2>Personal data and purposes</h2>
    <p>When you contact us by phone or WhatsApp, we may receive your name, phone number, the content of your inquiry and any contact details you choose to share. We use this information to respond, arrange appointments and follow up on your request. You do not need to send clinical information to request an appointment.</p>
    <p>Health information is sensitive personal data. If your care requires medical history, test results or other clinical data, the practice must explain its purposes and obtain the appropriate consent when required. This notice covers contact through the website; it does not replace the privacy and consent documents associated with your clinical record.</p>
    <h2>Use, disclosure and retention</h2>
    <p>The purpose of contact is to address your request. Any additional use requiring your authorization must be explained and consented to separately. You may request limits on the use or disclosure of your information through the channels below. Data retention and deletion are subject to the purpose of your request and applicable legal obligations.</p>
    <h2>Your rights and how to exercise them</h2>
    <p>You may request access to, correction or cancellation of your data, or object to its processing (ARCO rights under Mexican law). You may also withdraw consent or limit its use by submitting a written request addressed to Lourdes Carrillo Rojas at Circuito Historiadores S 44, Local 3, Ciudad Satélite, Naucalpan, Estado de México, postal code 53100, México. For guidance on submitting your request, call <a href="tel:+525553938629">55 5393 8629</a> or contact us on <a href="https://wa.me/525534360587" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp: 55 3436 0587</a>.</p>
    <p>Include your name, a contact method for our response, the right you wish to exercise and a description of your request. To protect your information, your identity or legal representation will be verified, and only necessary documents will be requested through a channel agreed with you. A response will be sent through your specified channel within applicable legal deadlines. Cancellation and withdrawal of consent may be limited by retention obligations or other legal requirements.</p>
    <h2>External services and browsing data</h2>
    <p>This website has no registration forms or its own advertising or analytics tools. The hosting provider may process technical connection data, such as IP addresses and access logs, to provide and protect the service.</p>
    <p>The contact section embeds Google Maps. When the map loads, Google may receive technical connection data and use cookies according to its <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a>. You can manage cookies through your browser.</p>
    <p>If you choose WhatsApp, Instagram or an external link, the relevant service will process your data under its own policies. This notice does not authorize data transfers for purposes unrelated to your request. When a transfer requires consent, it must be obtained beforehand, except where a legal exemption applies.</p>
